message: "Cite this catalog if it informs resource selection, and retain the EyeDataHub attribution in UPSTREAM_NOTICE.md when reusing the derived catalog. Cite original dataset publications and releases when using their data. Component-specific license scopes: https://github.com/ney777/awesome-retinal-aging-datasets/blob/main/LICENSE.md"
