# CFF 1.2.0 license arrays mean OR, and license-url is for non-SPDX licenses.
# Neither encodes path-specific scopes for this mixed-content repository.
# Omit these optional fields; the message and abstract identify the scope notice.
abstract: "An evidence-linked catalog for retinal aging, eye–brain, neurological and systemic health research. Includes the 451-record EyeDataHub v0.7.0 baseline, 28 additions, topic-specific evidence tiers, access scopes and reproducible ranking tables. Original software is MIT; the upstream metadata and derived catalog are CC BY 4.0. Dataset and gallery assets retain their own licenses."
